Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

# Type out the command to run your TUI
Type "go run ./..."
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Simulate keyboard navigation inside your app
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down 2
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 5s

# Exit your TUI cleanly
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
